v data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1645698462577" class="gf_row gf_equal-height gf_row-gap-0" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1645698462577" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;" data-row-gap="0px"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1634704950046" data-id="1634704950046" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1645698462608" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1645698462608" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs"><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/ee2273fb-34e1-4d2b-b443-bb4b32c0b2ff/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/image%2069.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1634704956996" data-id="1634704956996" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1645698462547" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1645698462547"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">カポックノット代表　深井喜翔</h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1645698462630" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1645698462630"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-sm gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>初めましてカポックノット創業者の深井喜翔です。</p><p>老舗アパレル企業の4代目として、また繊維業界に身を置くことで、アパレル業界の大量生産・大量廃棄という負のシステム、そしてそのシステムが生み出す弊害を目の当たりにしてきました。</p><p>そんな中、カポックと出会い、「これこそが自分が人生を懸けて取り組むべき素材である」という感覚を持ちました。</p><p>「消費者」「生産者」「環境」の3つの視点に立ち、製品ができてから届くまでに関わる全ての人たちに寄り添ったものづくりをしていきます。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" class="gf_row gf_row-gap-15" id="r-1645698468875" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1645698468875" data-row-gap="15px" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12 gf_col-lg-12" id="c-1634705005020" data-id="1634705005020"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1645698468835" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1645698468835"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">カポックノットの価値観</h1></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1645698468783" class="gf_row gf_equal-height gf_row-gap-0" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1645698468783" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="12+12" data-layout-xs="12+12" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;" data-row-gap="0px"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-xs-12 gf_col-sm-12" id="c-1634705047779" data-id="1634705047779" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1645698468843" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1645698468843" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-sm" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/1573de7b-7ae4-497e-b340-1970bc5ca977/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/image%2068.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="60%" data-height="auto" title="" width="580" height="618" natural-width="580" natural-height="618"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-xs-12 gf_col-sm-12" id="c-1634705053643" data-id="1634705053643" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1645698468803" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1645698468803"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1634705093608" data-id="1634705093608"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1645698468873" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1645698468873"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">次世代に託す地球環境への還元</h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1645698468862" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1645698468862"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>サステナブルな素材を活用し、持続可能なビジネスを展開し、その利益の一部で地球環境再生に貢献します</p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1645698468872" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1645698468872"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1634705093608" data-id="1634705093608"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1645698468863" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1645698468863"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">生産者に優しいものづくり</h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1645698468838" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1645698468838"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>受け継いできた技術と革新的な技術を活かし、原料生産元からお客様の手に届くまで独自のサプライチェーンを構築し、生産者にも優しいものづくりをしていきます</p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1645698468801" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1645698468801"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1634705093608" data-id="1634705093608"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1645698468808" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1645698468808"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-md" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">より軽く、より暖かく</h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1645698468844" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1645698468844"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>軽さと吸湿発熱の機能を持つカポックによって、着膨れしない「軽い、薄い、暖かい」スタイリッシュなアウターを実現します</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" class="gf_row" id="r-1645698476984" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1645698476984"><div class="gf_column gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12 gf_col-lg-12" id="c-1634701146637" data-id="1634701146637"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1645698476909" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1645698476909"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">クリエイターの皆様からも共感いただいています</h1></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1645698476962" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1645698476962" data-extraclass="" data-layout-lg="4+4+4" data-layout-md="4+4+4" data-layout-sm="4+4+4" data-layout-xs="12+12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-4 gf_col-md